      "description": "Aziel Eliab (also Aziel Elroi Eliab) is the living publisher of GodLock, Aziel Digital Library, aziel-runtime MCP, and He Didn't Jump. Canonical person: https://www.azieleliab.com/#aziel. GodLock is a product, not this Person.",
